# March of the World Ooze, {3}{G}{G}{G}: "Creatures you control have base power and toughness 6/6 and are Oozes in addition to their other
# types." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with Black Lotus and three Moxen: its Memnite and Ornithopter (1/1 and 0/2 artifact creatures) become 6/6
# Oozes that keep their types and Ornithopter its flying, while Mox Emerald, no creature, is untouched. Bot2's Phyrexian Walker, cast on turn 2, is
# still a 0/3 Construct. On turn 3 a Giant Growth on Bot1's Memnite makes it 9/9: the +3/+3 applies to the base 6/6 (CR 613.4). Bot2
# casting a spell on its own turn 2 or Bot1 casting on its own turn 3 does not trigger the Elephant: "not their turn" means the
# caster's own turn. Bot1 has no Elephant token at the end.

